6,"The traditional music of the Qiang, Pumi and Lisu ... - 資訊咖",https://inf.news/en/culture/f06f61414c45d182ef5689fbc0d80da1.html,"May 27, 2026 · The Sino-Tibetan language family is one of the largest and most dynamic language families in the world, with more than one billion speakers. What I want to introduce today is the traditional music of the Qiang, Pumi and Lisu people under the Sino-Tibetan language family.",Samei,Sino-Tibetan
